="TABLE_STD2"><div name="8104352" id="8104352"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:3.0%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:  normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«</p></td><td style="width:31.9%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="31%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:11.24%;border:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="11%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:25.02%;border:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt" valign="top" width="25%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:26.98%;border:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt" valign="top" width="26%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="width:3.0%;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">22.</p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width:31.9%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="31%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ўзбекистон Республикасида Экологик таълимни ривожлантириш концепцияси</p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal"><i style="font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Вазирлар Маҳкамасининг 434-сонли қарори, 27.05.2019 й.)</i></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width:11.24%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="11%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2026 йил декабрь</p></td><td colspan="2" style="width:52.0%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt" valign="top" width="52%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Ижро учун асосий масъул — Экология ва иқлим ўзгариши миллий қўмитаси</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:25.02%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt" valign="top" width="25%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Мактабгача ва мактаб таълими вазирлиги,</p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги,</p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</p></td><td style="width:26.98%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt" valign="top" width="26%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Марказий Осиё атроф-муҳит ва иқлим ўзгаришини ўрганиш университети</p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Green University),</p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Оила ва гендер илмий-тадқиқот институти</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:3.0%;border:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:31.9%;border:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="31%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:11.24%;border:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="11%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:25.02%;border:none;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt" valign="top" width="25%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:26.98%;border:none;padding:0in 3.0pt 0in 3.0pt" valign="top" width="26%"><p align="right" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:right;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">»</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8104339" id="8104339">6. Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2023 йил 27 июлдаги «Туризм йўналишидаги ислоҳотларни янада жадаллаштириш ва соҳада давлат бошқаруви тизимини самарали ташкил қилиш чора-тадбирлари тўғрисида»ги ПҚ-238-сон қарорининг <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/6549286?ONDATE=18.01.2024 00#6765759">5-бандидаги</a> «2026» рақами «2029» рақами билан алмаштирилсин.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8104345" id="8104345">7. Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2024 йил 24 сентябрдаги «Чанг бўронларига қарши курашиш ва атмосфера ҳавоси сифатини яхшилаш бўйича биринчи навбатдаги чора-тадбирлар тўғрисида»ги ПҚ-338-сон қарорининг 4-банди <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/7112414?ONDATE=25.09.2024 00#7112534">учинчи хатбошисидаги </a>«2026» рақами «2027» рақами билан алмаштирилсин.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8104340" id="8104340">8. Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 14 августдаги «Қорақалпоғистон Республикасини ижтимоий-иқтисодий ривожлантиришга қаратилган чора-тадбирларни янада жадаллаштириш тўғрисида»ги ПҚ-248-сон қарорига <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/7685398?ONDATE=15.08.2025 00#7686771">6-илованинг</a> 14-позицияси қуйидаги таҳрирда баён этилсин:</div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="8104353" id="8104353"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:3.0%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:  normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«</p></td><td style="width:22.42%;border:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:  justify;text-indent:15.3pt;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:29.1%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="29%"><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:  justify;text-indent:8.8pt;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:10.74%;border:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:8.46%;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:24.36%;border:none;border-bottom:  solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="width:3.0%;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14.</p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width:22.42%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:  justify;text-indent:15.3pt;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">«Сайгачий» мажмуа (ландшафт) буюртма қўриқхонасида сайғоқларнинг популяциясини ошириш ва Қозоғистондан Ўзбекистонга сайғоқларнинг миграциясини қайта тиклаш.</p></td><td style="width:29.1%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="29%"><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:  justify;text-indent:8.8pt;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">1. Сайғоқларнинг миграциясини тиклаш ҳамда популяциясини ошириш бўйича ишчи гуруҳни ташкил қилиш.</p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:  justify;text-indent:8.8pt;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2. Ишчи гуруҳни Қозоғистон Республикасига хизмат сафарига юбориш.</p><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:  justify;text-indent:8.8pt;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">3. «Сайгачий» мажмуа (ландшафт) буюртма қўриқхонасига камида 500 та сайғоқни олиб келиш, Қозоғистон Республикаси билан Шалқар — Бейнеу темир йўл линиясида сайғоқлар ўтиши учун йўлаклар барпо қилиш ва чегара ҳудудида миграция йўлларини кўпайтириш бўйича икки томонлама музокаралар ўтказиш.</p></td><td style="width:10.74%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Амалий чора-тадбирлар</p></td><td style="width:8.46%;border:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2026 йил август</p></td><td rowspan="2" style="width:24.36%;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Бош вазир ўринбосари</p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal"><i style="font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ж. Ходжаев)</i><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Экология ва иқлим ўзгариши миллий қўмитаси</p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal"><i style="font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(А. Абдуҳакимов),</i></p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Давлат хавфсизлик хизмати</p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal"><i style="font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Б. Курбанов)</i><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">,</span></p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши</p><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal"><i style="font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">(Ф. Эрманов)</i></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:29.1%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="29%"><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:  justify;text-indent:8.8pt;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">4. Музокаралар натижаси бўйича таклифларни Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президенти Администрациясига киритиш.</p></td><td style="width:10.74%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Музокара якунидан кейин икки ҳафта муддатда</p></td><td style="width:8.46%;border-top:none;border-left:  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2026 йил октябрь</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:3.0%;border:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:22.42%;border:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:  justify;text-indent:15.3pt;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:29.1%;border:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="29%"><p style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:  justify;text-indent:8.8pt;line-height:normal;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:10.74%;border:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="10%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:8.46%;border:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="8%"><p align="center" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:center;line-height:normal;font-size:  12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"></p></td><td style="width:24.36%;border:none;padding:0in 2.85pt 0in 2.85pt" valign="top" width="24%"><p align="right" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:right;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">»</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8104343" id="8104343">9. Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 18 ноябрдаги ПҚ-343-сон қарори билан тасдиқланган Экология ва иқлим ўзгариши миллий қўмитаси тўғрисидаги низомнинг <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/7847341?ONDATE=19.11.2025 00#7849181">18-банди</a> қуйидаги таҳрирда баён этилсин:</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8104344" id="8104344">«18. Раиснинг Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президенти Администрацияси раҳбари томонидан лавозимга тайинланадиган ва лавозимдан озод этиладиган тўрт нафар ўринбосари, шу жумладан, бир нафар биринчи ўринбосари бўлади».</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="8104342" id="8104342">10. Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2026 йил 5 февралдаги «Кўп квартирали уйларни бошқариш тизимини янада такомиллаштириш бўйича қўшимча чора-тадбирлар тўғрисида»ги ПҚ-48-сон қарорининг <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/8037375?ONDATE=07.02.2026 00#8038155">7-бандидаги</a> «камида» сўзи чиқариб ташлансин.</div></div><div class="PUBLICATION_ORIGIN"><label id="s1089"></label><div name="8104204" id="8104204">(Қонунчилик маълумотлари миллий базаси, 30.03.2026 й., 06/26/46/0290-сон)</div></div></div>
</div></body></html>